          %h2#References References
          %h3#general General
          %p The concept was introduced in
          %ul
            %li#Wegner71
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Franz+Wegner"}> Franz Wegner
                \:
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Duality in Generalized Ising Models and Phase Transitions without Local Order Parameters
                %strong 12
